+/**
+ * Convert a wildcard pattern (e.g. `order.*` or `*.created`) into a RegExp
+ * that matches a full topic string.
+ *
+ * Rules:
+ *  - `*` matches exactly one dot-separated segment (one or more non-dot chars).
